leaseNotesByLocale":{"zh-CN":{"title":"Release v3.3.6","markdown":"## 问题修复\n\n- 优化代码库 Wiki 生成能力，同时支持多语言。\n- Markdown 表格支持更好地横向滚动。\n- 修复启动时工作区不可用导致的异常。\n- 修复插件安装和同步失败后的残留问题。\n- 修复登录授权异常时无法恢复的问题。\n- 修复模型不可用时提示不清或选择丢失的问题。\n- 修复自定义模型重启后未保留的问题。\n- 修复聊天查找、历史切换等快捷操作异常。\n- 修复文件树刷新失败或显示状态不准的问题。\n- 修复 Markdown 表格滚动方向和边界问题。\n- 修复后台任务计时、控制按钮丢失问题。\n- 修复 SQL 差异预览可能崩溃的问题。\n- 修复 Linux 图标和标题栏显示问题。\n- 修复未读标记重启后丢失的问题。"},"en-US":{"title":"Release v3.3.6","markdown":"## Bug Fixes\n\n- Optimize the Wiki generation capability of the codebase while supporting multiple languages.\n- Markdown tables now support better horizontal scrolling.\n- Fixed the exception caused by the workspace being unavailable at startup.\n- Fixed the residual issue after plugin installation and synchronization failure.\n- Fixed the issue where recovery was not possible when login authorization encountered an exception.\n- Fixed the issue where unclear prompts or selection loss occurred when the model was unavailable.\n- Fixed the issue where custom models were not retained after a restart.\n- Fixed abnormal quick operations such as chat search and history switching.\n- Fixed the issue where the file tree fails to refresh or displays incorrect status.\n- Fixed the scrolling direction and boundary issues of Markdown tables.\n- Fixed the issue where the timing and control buttons for background tasks were missing.\n- Fixed an issue where the SQL diff preview might crash.\n- Fixed the display issue of icons and title bar on Linux.\n- Fixed the issue where unread markers would be lost after a restart."}}},"settingsSyncFirstRunPromptHandled":true}
